I've been having this problem for a couple months, but didn't really pay
much attention over to it over the summer & all, but now its becoming
irritation:

* I'm running a VAX 4000/200 with 2 DS300 terminal servers. I'm using
VMS 5.4-2 w/ a patch for 4000/200s. (though this problem has occured
both before & after installation of the patch).

* At random intervals, one or both of the DS300s will crash, usually
leaving a crash dump. When they both crash, they crash within 1 sec.
of each other. Sometimes, though, only one crashes. Also, I'm not sure
that they each leave dumps EVERY time they crash, but the do sometimes.

Case in point: This monday, one of my DS300s crashed twice (once in the
